; エレベーター稼働音
@PlayBgm BgmPath:Ambi_5_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_22_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:（目标是——那些被冰封的牺牲者们）|#0204Adv12_Hiro001| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:之前我多次进入冷冻室，<br>却始终无法直视那些被冰封的少女们。|#0204Adv12_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:牺牲者太多了。<br>化为残骸的奈叶香和玛格，<br>以及遇害的可可和安安应该也在其中。|#0204Adv12_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:诺亚不在其中，<br>想到这里，也让我心中一阵绞痛。|#0204Adv12_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:然而——现在已无暇思考这些了。|#0204Adv12_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:希罗，昨晚是发生什么了吗……？<br>感觉好像有什么事情，<br>把你逼到了绝境……|#0204Adv12_Leia001| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我知道与我同乘电梯的蕾雅，<br>正在露出担忧的神情看着我。|#0204Adv12_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:而我故意不看向她，<br>只轻轻地摇了摇头。|#0204Adv12_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:……没什么。|#0204Adv12_Hiro002| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:是吗……不过，就算只是细枝末节的小事，<br>只要有一点令你挂心，都可以跟我说说。|#0204Adv12_Leia002| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:你不是孤身一人。|#0204Adv12_Leia003| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:…………|#0204Adv12_Hiro003| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; エレベーター到着音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_68 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

@StopBgm BgmPath:Ambi_5_1

