@Wait WaitMode:1.8

[PrintTextModified Text:我和蕾雅等待着接连从电梯里下来的少女们。|#0204Adv12_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:1 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,50 AppearanceAndTransition:31_3

[PrintTextModified Text:我、蕾雅、艾玛、雪莉、汉娜、米莉亚。<br>六个人到齐后，蕾雅开口说道。|#0204Adv12_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Scale:1 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:各自去调查<br>自己在意的地方效率会更高，<br>我们暂且分头行动吧。|#0204Adv12_Leia004| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:解散之前先定下汇合时间。|#0204Adv12_Leia005| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯……<br>考虑到返回地下也需要时间，<br>就定在下午2点50分，在这里汇合吧。|#0204Adv12_Leia006| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@StopBgm FadeOutDuration:3

[PrintTextModified Text:大家都没有异议，<br>各自散开来自行调查了。|#0204Adv12_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我立刻朝着冷冻室跑去。|#0204Adv12_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@ModifyBackgroundExtended DissolveTexturePath:VerticalBlindGradually TintColor:#000000 Duration:0.9 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor.Custom SubId:Overlay
