[PrintTextModified Text:抵达冷冻室后，<br>我马上开始检查那些被冰封的牺牲者们。|#0204Adv12_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:呜……这里每次来都是这么寒冷……|#0204Adv12_Leia007| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:你是要调查【残骸】吗？|#0204Adv12_Leia008| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Scale:1 Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Closed

[PrintTextModified Text:我瞥了一眼蕾雅，<br>她正冻得发抖，却还是跟着我走进了冷冻室。|#0204Adv12_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不。<br>我的目标是【冰上梅露露】的尸体。|#0204Adv12_Hiro004| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露的……！？|#0204Adv12_Leia009| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯。典狱长说过，<br>她是主人。<br>既然如此，她的尸体肯定保存着吧。|#0204Adv12_Hiro005| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:因为这里是魔女们长眠的地方。|#0204Adv12_Hiro006| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:这样啊……我明白了。<br>我也会全力寻找的！|#0204Adv12_Leia010| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:蕾雅把手放在胸前，<br>干劲十足地开始检查那些被冰封的魔女。|#0204Adv12_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不靠近仔细看的话，<br>根本不知道冰块里冻着的是什么，而且数量非常庞大。|#0204Adv12_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我们分头行动，<br>开始寻找梅露露的尸体。|#0204Adv12_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不久前来这里时，<br>不知是不是由于冷冻功能发生故障了，<br>巨大的冰块融成小块，散落得到处都是。|#0204Adv12_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:感觉寒冷程度也<br>稍微缓解了一些。|#0204Adv12_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Closed

[PrintTextModified Text:"（最接近大魔女的人，<br>　就是一直计划着要再见到她的梅露露）|#0204Adv12_Hiro007|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（既然如此，梅露露手上一定会有。<br>　那就是关于大魔女的线索——！）|#0204Adv12_Hiro008|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

