[PrintTextModified Text:大叔我这老骨头实在扛不住这严寒啊……<br>呜呜，好想回到被窝里暖暖。|#0204Adv12_Miria001| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:别撒娇了。再说你也不是大叔。|#0204Adv12_Hiro010| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

