; ＠備考◆息切れ

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:哈啊、哈啊、哈啊……！|#0204Adv12_Hiro014| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; 氷を突き崩す音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_175 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:我全神贯注地不停挥动着冰镐。<br>指尖已经完全没有感觉了。|#0204Adv12_Narrative023| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:欸、那个，希罗啊。<br>是不是该休息一下比较好？<br>这样下去会冻僵的……|#0204Adv12_Miria002| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……别管我！<br>再努力一下，就差一点了……！|#0204Adv12_Hiro015| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; 氷を突き崩す音2
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_176 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

; ＠備考◆驚き

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Miria.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:啊……！|#0204Adv12_Miria003| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

