[PrintTextModified Text:希罗，你怎么了……？<br>没事吧……？|#0204Adv12_Miria004| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:果然，果然是这样……|#0204Adv12_Hiro018| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Miria.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:欸……？<br>那张照片到底有什么，<br>能让你那么震惊？|#0204Adv12_Miria005| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:米莉亚探头看着我手中的照片，<br>困惑地歪着头。|#0204Adv12_Narrative033| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:米莉亚当然不明白。<br>这是只有我和艾玛才知道的事。|#0204Adv12_Narrative034| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

