[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露敬慕地称之为大魔女大人的少女——|#0204Adv12_Narrative035| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她就是我们初中时代的共同好友——<br>【月代雪】。|#0204Adv12_Narrative036| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideActors ActorIds:Stills Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:我的表情开始扭曲。|#0204Adv12_Narrative037| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我一直以来，都误会了……！|#0204Adv12_Hiro019| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:错误的原来是，我自己！！|#0204Adv12_Hiro020| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:已经没有余力去管米莉亚了，<br>我大叫着，朝着出入口跑去。|#0204Adv12_Narrative038| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@StopBgm FadeOutDuration:3

[PrintTextModified Text:（我必须向艾玛道歉……！）|#0204Adv12_Hiro021| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（我、我居然做了这么过分的事……！）|#0204Adv12_Hiro022| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我必须立刻见到艾玛和她谈谈。|#0204Adv12_Narrative039| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

