[PrintTextModified Text:由于集合时间将近，<br>回到电梯口时，<br>雪莉和汉娜已经在那里等着了。|#0204Adv12_Narrative040| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她们似乎正坐在那里休息，<br>看到我们来了就站了起来。|#0204Adv12_Narrative041| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20,50 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80,50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，你们回来了哇。|#0204Adv12_Hanna002| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:因为集合时间到了，<br>我就想着你们差不多该来了，一直在这里等着。|#0204Adv12_Sherry002| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛呢！？|#0204Adv12_Hiro023| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:你说艾玛？她不在里面吗？|#0204Adv12_Sherry003| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:大叔我和小希<br>刚才在冷冻室，<br>但在去冷冻室的路上也没看到小艾哦。|#0204Adv12_Miria006| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hanna

[PrintTextModified Text:蕾雅也没来呢……|#0204Adv12_Hanna003| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Sherry

[PrintTextModified Text:会不会是先上去了？|#0204Adv12_Sherry004| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Closed

[PrintTextModified Text:……必须回牢房了，<br>没办法，我们也上去吧。|#0204Adv12_Hiro024| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

