@ModifyBackgroundExtended Duration:1 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:31_5
@Wait WaitMode:1.2

[PrintTextModified Text:我的脸色一定很苍白。<br>汉娜和雪莉虽然面带疑惑，<br>但还是走进了电梯。|#0204Adv12_Narrative042| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……然而。|#0204Adv12_Narrative043| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; エレベーターブザー音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_146 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

@ModifyCharacterExtended Scale:1 Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Pensive1

@Wait WaitMode:0.5

[PrintTextModified Text:咦？电梯不动……？|#0204Adv12_Sherry005| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Scale:1 Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hanna

[PrintTextModified Text:难道是坏了……？|#0204Adv12_Hanna004| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideActors ActorIds:Sherry Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉从电梯里下来后，<br>警示音就停止了。|#0204Adv12_Narrative044| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Scale:1 Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:看来只能一次上去一个人了。<br>汉娜你先请吧！|#0204Adv12_Sherry006| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hanna

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜点了点头，<br>关上了电梯门。|#0204Adv12_Narrative045| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Duration:1 Lazy:false
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:2 Duration:1 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:31_4
@Wait WaitMode:1.2

[PrintTextModified Text:等了一小会，<br>电梯终于下来了。<br>接着雪莉走了进去。|#0204Adv12_Narrative046| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:2 Duration:1 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:31_5
@Wait WaitMode:1.2
@ModifyCharacterExtended Duration:1 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1
@HideAllCharacters Duration:1 Lazy:false
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:2 Duration:1 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:31_4
@Wait WaitMode:1.2

[PrintTextModified Text:站在我旁边的米莉亚，发抖得很厉害。|#0204Adv12_Narrative047| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hiro
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Fearful1

[PrintTextModified Text:……下一个你去吧。|#0204Adv12_Hiro025| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Miria.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:欸，可是……|#0204Adv12_Miria007| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:顺序什么的无所谓吧。<br>不管怎样，所有人都必须回到上面去。|#0204Adv12_Hiro026| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideActors ActorIds:Hiro Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:米莉亚小心翼翼，<br>走进了回来的电梯。|#0204Adv12_Narrative048| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:2 Duration:1 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:31_5
@Wait WaitMode:1.2
@ModifyCharacterExtended Duration:1 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Pensive1
@HideAllCharacters Duration:1 Lazy:false
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:2 Duration:1 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:31_4
@Wait WaitMode:1.2

[PrintTextModified Text:只剩下我一个人了。<br>我焦急地等待着电梯到达。|#0204Adv12_Narrative049| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（该对艾玛说什么才好。<br>　该用什么表情见她）|#0204Adv12_Hiro027|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（就算我承认，<br>　我的杀意和憎恶，一切都是错的，<br>　但事到如今，我所做的事也不会一笔勾销……）|#0204Adv12_Hiro028|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（即便如此，即便如此我也想向她道歉。<br>　我错了。<br>　我根本就没有什么正确……！）|#0204Adv12_Hiro029|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我忍住哭泣的冲动，用力咬紧嘴唇。|#0204Adv12_Narrative050| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:即使这样，艾玛<br>还会笑着对我吗？|#0204Adv12_Narrative051| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:但我很了解她。<br>我应该是了解她的。|#0204Adv12_Narrative052| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她一定会笑着<br>呼唤我的名字吧。|#0204Adv12_Narrative053| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——没关系的，希罗。|#0204Adv12_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——因为我们，是朋友啊。|#0204Adv12_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

