[PrintTextModified Text:——|#0204Adv12_Hiro030| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:映入眼帘的景象，<br>令我一时间难以理解。|#0204Adv12_Narrative056| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:电梯狭小的空间里，<br>昏暗的灯光朦胧地照着。|#0204Adv12_Narrative057| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:赤蝶四下蹁跹飞舞，红影摇曳——|#0204Adv12_Narrative058| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:而在其中央，是艾玛的身影。|#0204Adv12_Narrative059| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她就像断了线的玩偶一样，<br>穿着礼服，毫无防备地倒在那里。|#0204Adv12_Narrative060| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:胸口插着一把刺剑——|#0204Adv12_Narrative061| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛已经完全停止了生命活动。|#0204Adv12_Narrative062| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆絶望絶叫

[PrintTextModified Text:啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊——！！|#0204Adv12_Hiro031| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我抱头大喊。|#0204Adv12_Narrative063| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆絶望絶叫

[PrintTextModified Text:为什么，为什么为什么……！！<br>啊啊啊啊啊啊、啊啊！！|#0204Adv12_Hiro032| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我只能疯狂地<br>不断尖叫。|#0204Adv12_Narrative064| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:脑中一片混乱，<br>但还是想着必须要上去。|#0204Adv12_Narrative065| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; エレベーターブザー音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_146 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:我乘上电梯，<br>但却因为电梯里还有艾玛的尸体，警示音响个不停。|#0204Adv12_Narrative066| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（……对了……要先把发现尸体的现场……<br>　保存下来……）|#0204Adv12_Hiro033|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:眼神空洞地拿出手机。|#0204Adv12_Narrative067| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; 写真撮影音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_28 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:我几乎是在无意识的状态下，<br>拍下了艾玛的尸体。|#0204Adv12_Narrative068| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:然后，我试图把艾玛的尸体从电梯里拖出来。|#0204Adv12_Narrative069| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Duration:0.9 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.2

[PrintTextModified Text:…………|#0204Adv12_Hiro034| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:大脑一片空白。<br>什么都无法思考。|#0204Adv12_Narrative070| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:双手沾满了鲜血。<br>那是艾玛的血。|#0204Adv12_Narrative071| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我浑身是血，<br>艰难地把艾玛从电梯里拖了下来。|#0204Adv12_Narrative072| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:然后，茫然按下了上升按钮。|#0204Adv12_Narrative073| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

