@ModifyBackgroundExtended Duration:0.8 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:0.9

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜、雪莉、米莉亚三人，<br>正在招待所里等着我到来。|#0204Adv12_Narrative074| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Scale:1 Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Surprised1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Scale:1 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Surprised1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Scale:1 Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:看到我出现，<br>三人都露出了惊愕的表情。|#0204Adv12_Narrative075| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:希罗，你、你、你怎么了？<br>你的手……！|#0204Adv12_Miria008| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她们惊愕于<br>我的双手沾满了鲜血。|#0204Adv12_Narrative076| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛……被杀了……<br>在电梯里……被刺死了。|#0204Adv12_Hiro035| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我用微弱的声音自言自语。|#0204Adv12_Narrative077| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:尽管是自己口中说出来的话，<br>却没有一丝真实感。|#0204Adv12_Narrative078| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:米莉亚、雪莉、汉娜，<br>都是一副难以置信的表情。|#0204Adv12_Narrative079| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:怎么会。这不可能。<br>大叔我进电梯的时候，<br>根本没有什么尸体。|#0204Adv12_Miria009| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我乘电梯的时候，<br>连艾玛的影子也没看见。|#0204Adv12_Sherry007| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我也没有看到呢。|#0204Adv12_Hanna005| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她们虽然感到困惑，<br>但看到我苍白的脸色，也察觉到这似乎不是玩笑。|#0204Adv12_Narrative080| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她们看我的眼神，<br>逐渐开始变得怀疑。|#0204Adv12_Narrative081| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Pensive1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Pensive1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:难道，是希罗你在地下……？|#0204Adv12_Sherry008| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆カッとしかかる

[PrintTextModified Text:——！|#0204Adv12_Hiro036| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（不是我！！）|#0204Adv12_Hiro037| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我差点就控制不住感情大喊出来，<br>在最后一刻忍住了。|#0204Adv12_Narrative082| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……我的魔女化进程正在加速，<br>她们也注意到了这个事实。|#0204Adv12_Narrative083| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:就算她们认为我怀有杀意，<br>并把杀意投向了某个人，也是正常的。|#0204Adv12_Narrative084| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:现在，假如我在这里情绪失控地大喊大叫，<br>先崩溃发疯的可能是我自己。|#0204Adv12_Narrative085| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:必须强行压抑住自己的感情。|#0204Adv12_Narrative086| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:之后，为了再下去一次，<br>我掉头离开。|#0204Adv12_Narrative087| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:希罗，你、你要去哪里……？|#0204Adv12_Hanna006| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:调查电梯。<br>凶手有可能藏在电梯的顶盖上面。|#0204Adv12_Hiro038| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:31_4

[PrintTextModified Text:来到半地下层，<br>我注意到电梯旁边有一个高度正好的人字梯。|#0204Adv12_Narrative088| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,50 AppearanceAndTransition:31_5
@Wait WaitMode:0.5
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale}1 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,50 AppearanceAndTransition:31_5
@Wait WaitMode:1.2

[PrintTextModified Text:于是我把人字梯搬进电梯，<br>从电梯顶盖的洞里探出头。|#0204Adv12_Narrative089| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Duration:0.9 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.2

[PrintTextModified Text:此时某样东西映入眼帘——|#0204Adv12_Narrative090| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那正是浑身是血倒在那里的，少女的尸体。|#0204Adv12_Narrative091| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

