[PrintTextModified Text:尸体戴着一顶王冠，犹如王子。|#0204Adv12_Narrative092| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那就像是为了呼应，<br>身着连衣裙死去的艾玛公主般的打扮一般。|#0204Adv12_Narrative093| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:而为这戏剧般的一幕添上色彩的是，<br>上下纷舞的赤蝶。|#0204Adv12_Narrative094| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:若这一切真是虚构，若真是戏剧，<br>那该多有好。|#0204Adv12_Narrative095| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:可是，<br>我眼中映出的身姿千真万确——|#0204Adv12_Narrative096| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:莲见蕾雅死了。|#0204Adv12_Narrative097| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——|#0204Adv12_Hiro039| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我想叫喊，<br>却已经喊不出声。|#0204Adv12_Narrative098| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

